{
  "title": "Velvety Comforting Norwegian Beef Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting Norwegian stew featuring tender beef and a rich, citrusy broth, made with low-calorie ingredients for a guilt-free meal. This dish is perfect for a cold winter's night.",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
